{
  "id": "E157",
  "title": "I Like Autumn the Most",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-10-07",
  "synopsis": "Three reasons why autumn is the best season.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/544/93349cb83de5790ae33c0d52cb1c9499ab4b9c87.mp3?1507052256",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我最喜欢秋天\n\n    我为什么喜欢秋天？因为秋天很漂亮，树叶会变成黄色、红色，落在地上。秋天天气也很好，常常是晴天，不太冷也不太热。秋天还有很多好吃的水果，我最喜欢桔子和梨。",
    "traditional": "我最喜歡秋天\n\n    我為什麼喜歡秋天？因為秋天很漂亮，樹葉會變成黃色、紅色，落在地上。秋天天氣也很好，常常是晴天，不太冷也不太熱。秋天還有很多好吃的水果，我最喜歡桔子和梨。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I like autumn the most"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我为什么喜欢秋天？",
      "traditional": "我為什麼喜歡秋天？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ wèi shén me xǐ huan qiū tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "因为秋天很漂亮，树叶会变成黄色、红色，落在地上。",
      "traditional": "因為秋天很漂亮，樹葉會變成黃色、紅色，落在地上。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi qiū tiān hěn piào liang shù yè huì biàn chéng huáng sè hóng sè luò zài dì shang",
      "english": "Why do I like autumn?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "秋天天气也很好，常常是晴天，不太冷也不太热。",
      "traditional": "秋天天氣也很好，常常是晴天，不太冷也不太熱。",
      "pinyin": "qiū tiān tiān qì yě hěn hǎo cháng cháng shì qíng tiān bú tài lěng yě bú tài rè",
      "english": "Because autumn is beautiful, with yellow and red leafs falling to the ground."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "秋天还有很多好吃的水果，我最喜欢桔子和梨。",
      "traditional": "秋天還有很多好吃的水果，我最喜歡桔子和梨。",
      "pinyin": "qiū tiān hái yǒu hěn duō hǎo chī de shuǐ guǒ wǒ zuì xǐ huan jú zi hé lí",
      "english": "The weather in autumn is also very nice, often sunny and not too cold or too warm."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There are so many tasty fruits in autumn. I like tangerines and pears the most."
    }
  ],
